  "description": "An enormous fortune, a beautiful sprawling estate, and five adoring male maids... what more could a gal wish for? Yeon-Hwa Lee is living out every girl's fantasy when she suddenly inherits her grandfather's estate, including his five loyal servants. Bom and Yeong-Ho are so cute and adorable, Alexander is buff and sexy, while Won-Hu and Edward are elegant and cool. Their only desire is to service their mistress... and Yeon-Hwa simply can't resist. \n\n(Source: Tapas, edited) \n\n*Note: Includes a prologue and 11 extra chapters.*",
